sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client in linked VNet
  participant R as DNS resolver
  participant Z as Private DNS zone
  participant P as Private Endpoint IP
  participant S as Azure Storage
  C->>R: Resolve account.blob.core.windows.net
  R->>Z: Query Private Link namespace
  Z-->>R: Private A record
  R-->>C: Endpoint private IP
  C->>P: HTTPS TCP/443
  P->>S: Private Link connection
  S-->>C: Response
